## 🚀 Features

- ➕ Addition
- ➖ Subtraction
- ✖ Multiplication
- ➗ Division
- ❌ Divide by Zero Handling
- 🔄 Reset Button
- ⌨️ Press Enter to Calculate
- 📱 Responsive Design
- 🎨 Modern Glassmorphism UI
- ⚡ Fast and Lightweight

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (Switch Case)

